<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div align="center" style=""><div align="center" style="text-align: center;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><div align="center" style="text-align: start;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014C39D50" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F987FD0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CCB830"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014DE0370" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E6B1D00" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E6B55F0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F985B30"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F9851D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F9843D0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F984500"><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CCFF70"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F9865E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F986360" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F9850A0" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F987660" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014E0BAD0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014445D50"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014449C90"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F97CBE0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014E2E740" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QBR_eDM_Banner.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018EB4CF0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5DF60"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014DE5DA0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014DE3590" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F97DA00"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014E055C0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F97ECC0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CB4F80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020607830"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014DD43A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hello,</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E5E550"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CA7770" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CB2980"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CCEC70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666">We can see your business is yet to utilise your annual Qantas Business Rewards Level 3 exclusive benefit – Gold Accelerator</font></font><sup><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;color:#7B7B7B;
mso-ansi-language:EN-AU;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">§</span></sup><font color="#666666" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">. As it is coming up to the anniversary of the launch of this new Level 3 benefit, the annual nomination is due to reset.&nbsp;</font><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001444FB80" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Nominate by 14 March 2023</strong><font color="#666666" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;to ensure your business can take advantage of this benefit.</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#666666"><br></font><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014E2E9A0"><font color="#666666">As a Level 3 Qantas Business Rewards member, you can nominate one traveller per year for a Gold Accelerator, allowing you to fast track their Frequent Flyer status to Gold. Once activated, the nominated Frequent Flyer will have 90 days to earn 200 Status Credits on new Qantas flight bookings departing within that period to achieve Gold Frequent Flyer status. You can nominate your Gold Accelerator through the&nbsp;</font><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014E06170" style="text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><u data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F988820" style=""><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/account-settings/memberships"><font color="#666666">Account Settings</font></a></u></strong><font color="#666666">&nbsp;page within your Qantas Business Rewards account.</font><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000020163400"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001444BB60"><font color="#666666">Once upgraded to Qantas Frequent Flyer Gold status, your traveller will have access to the below benefits:</font></font><ul style="margin: 5px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014C77280" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Access to over 600 lounges globally, which gives your traveller access to dining options and internet access, which may assist with increasing productivity and lowering additional costs while travelling;</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CCE1C0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">75% more Qantas Points on eligible flights with Qantas, Jetstar and American Airlines;</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014E08750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">On departure upgrades on Domestic Qantas operated flights using points;</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CADEF0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Premium boarding;</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014DFDB60" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Complimentary seat selection on Qantas operated international and domestic (excluding QantasLink) flights with a QF flight number;</font></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CD7E80" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Extra baggage allowance.</font></li></ul><div><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><font color="#666666" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Discover how your everyday business travel can get your traveller upgraded to Gold via our&nbsp;</font><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CAE610" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><u data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CCD250"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/frequent-flyer/calculators.html#/"><font color="#666666">Points and Status Credits Calculator</font></a></u></strong><font color="#666666" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">. Simply search the flights your traveller is likely to take during the 90 day period, to determine which routes and cabin class you will need to book for the member to obtain Gold.<br></font><font color="#666666" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br>It’s not too late to nominate before the benefit resets;</font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#666666">&nbsp;</font></span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/account-settings/memberships" target="_blank" title="Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CAC750" style="text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000011E6E3B0" style=""><u data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F9858E0" style=""><font color="#666666">login</font></u></strong></a><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">and submit your nomination today!</span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font color="#666666"><br></font></span><font color="#666666" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br>If you have a query, please feel free to contact your Qantas Business Rewards Service Centre on&nbsp;</font><font color="#666666" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">13 74 78 option 1.</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CAFA40"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CD73E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CAFCA0"></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CD7770"></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CA9190"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CA9D10" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014C7FA50"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CB51E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CB31D0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014848440" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014DE2B00" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014E092D0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018E69690"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CCF000" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014DDE010" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014DCC970"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CB2720"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014443C50" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014CB2BE0"><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014DFFFC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001F83E120" style="margin-l